Z||000004||theogre||10-23-1999||11:15 PM||||The reason I was changing bulbs was to install Phillips High Visibility lights. They are about 25$ for the pair. I only had them on breifly this evening, but they are already noticably better than standard halogen.<P>If your looking for better lights, hold off a day or 2 till I get to drive with them. These are much less expencive than allot of alternatives, and readily available at any Kmart. They are also 50 state legal DOT rated lamps which means fuzzy wuzzy won't be able to ****  people around over them.<P>I'll let everyone know how they turn out.||||reg||1
Z||000005||Dan||10-24-1999||09:52 AM|||| Yo Orgre, those are great lamps.Not only are the bulbs brighter but they project further and wider. Seems like you are driving with the brights on until you light up the world with your brights.Good buy.||||reg||1
